    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- `DELETE /v1/customers/{id}` soft-deletes (204, or 409 `has_active_subscriptions`). A deleted customer is hidden from every customer read, from invoice and subscription creation, and from its email index. Its invoices show `customer.deleted: true`.\n- `POST /v1/customers/{id}/restore` works within 30 days (200). It returns 404 after that or when the customer is not deleted, and 409 `email_taken` when the address is in use. `store.PurgeDeletedCustomers(now) int` removes customers deleted over 30 days ago.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass, with new store and API tests \n...[truncated]",
